  "notes": [
    "G05.1 documents shared Ruby regional isolation and tests synthetic Bag/PC inventories. No native save, Game.exe, JoiPlay or MapID accessed.",
    "Unova currently has six source-registry field actions and symbolic local event gates; HM item IDs and pickup events remain null/unverified.",
    "Actual Ruby stage_local_bag separates is_HM? and is_key_item? by metadata, saves them per region, preserves TM/TR/consumables/Mega Stones, and protects PC items.",
    "Unova does not have a proven local-pickup receipt like Sinnoh, and a fixture event flag must never be claimed as a native achievement.",
    "Tests of item-PC capacity use synthetic slot counts; native Essentials pockets, PC capacity, and rollback need later in-game verification.",
